sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant O as the orchestrator
    participant T as the ticket file<br/>in the tracker's checkout
    participant R as the report<br/>beside the worklog
    participant W as the worker
    O->>T: status: claimed
    O->>W: the ticket's context
    W->>R: its questions, its closing comment
    Note over R,W: the report existing is the finished signal
    W-->>O: exits
    R-->>O: dispatch fetch brings it back with the branch
    O->>T: dispatch review imports it: the comment,<br/>the questions, status: review
    Note over O,T: `tracker rule` answers a question here, before the merge
